@HOST = http://localhost
@ACCESS_TOKEN = CHANGEME
@BRAND_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@USER_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@WALLET_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@PAYMENT_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

# NOTA: `POST /payment/checkout` NO es el checkout orquestado. Cae en
# `PaymentService.createCheckout`, que guarda el `Payment` tal cual viene del body:
# NO resuelve el precio por `brand.country`, honra el `amount` y la `currency` que
# mande el cliente y no valida el `brandId`. El alta que resuelve precio por país es
# `POST /checkout` — ver `http/checkout.http`.
### Pagar plan con wallet interno
POST {{HOST}}/payment/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "plan_purchase",
  "purposeId": "pro",
  "provider": "wallet",
  "walletId": "{{WALLET_ID}}",
  "amount": 99000,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Pagar plan con Stripe
POST {{HOST}}/payment/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "plan_purchase",
  "purposeId": "pro",
  "provider": "stripe",
  "amount": 29.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "successUrl": "http://localhost/success",
  "cancelUrl": "http://localhost/cancel"
}

### Recarga de wallet con Stripe
POST {{HOST}}/payment/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "wallet_recharge",
  "provider": "stripe",
  "amount": 100000,
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Detalle de pago
GET {{HOST}}/payment/{{PAYMENT_ID}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Listar pagos de una marca
GET {{HOST}}/payment?brandId={{BRAND_ID}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Cancelar pago pendiente
POST {{HOST}}/payment/{{PAYMENT_ID}}/cancel HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
